Campaign "1" *-- "0..1" Trip : trip
Trip "1" *-- "1..*" Leg : legs {ordered}
Leg "*" --> "1" Vehicle : by
Leg "*" --> "2..*" SurfaceCell : cells {ordered}
Trip "*" --> "1" SurfaceCell : /at
LogEntry <|-- TripDay
